  "_doc": "ARMOR: helmet, chest, legs, boots. Basic pieces (\"tiers\": true) expand into Stock / Patched / Overclocked; Root pieces are fused uniques built on a basic piece (\"base\") and belong to one of five sets (Cablemail, Mainframe Plate, Kernel Panic, Floppy Scale, Liquid-Cooled). stats are Stock flat bonuses (scaled by rarity, Power and +upgrades). VISUALS: helmet parts are in HEAD units (1x1x1 box around the head centre, -z = face). chest: torso_color recolours the blazer and parts sit on the shoulders (authored for a 0.7 x 0.42 torso, y down from the shoulder line). legs: color recolours the trousers; parts are per leg, relative to the knee (+y up, -z front), mirrored on both legs. boots: color + sole recolour the shoes; parts are per foot, relative to the shoe centre. Parts with \"role\" get the Patched / Overclocked overlays automatically.",
